FastText ngram hashing
----------------------

The hashing in src/fse/_native_src/text/_native_hash.pxi is adapted directly
from Dictionary::hash and Dictionary::computeSubwords in fastText's
src/dictionary.cc (https://github.com/facebookresearch/fastText).

