Unicode Character Database
--------------------------

src/fse/_unicode.py and src/fse/_native_src/tables/_native_unicode.h hold the simple lowercase
mapping of UnicodeData.txt, Unicode 15.1.0, generated by
tools/make_unicode_tables.py. src/fse/_unicode_bert.py and
src/fse/_native_src/tables/_native_unicode_bert.h hold data of UnicodeData.txt of Unicode 8.0.0,
9.0.0 and 17.0.0 and of SpecialCasing.txt and PropList.txt of Unicode 17.0.0
(Copyright © 1991-2025 Unicode, Inc.), generated by
tools/make_wordpiece_tables.py. src/fse/_unicode_graphemes.py holds data of
GraphemeBreakProperty.txt, emoji-data.txt, DerivedCoreProperties.txt and
PropList.txt of Unicode 17.0.0, generated by tools/make_grapheme_tables.py with
src/fse/_native_src/tables/_native_unicode_graphemes.h, the same for the native code, and
tests/test_data/GraphemeBreakTest-17.0.0.txt is that file of Unicode 17.0.0,
unchanged. The data is used under the Unicode License v3:

